# 🏘️ AETHERIA — TOWN SQUARE SYSTEM

> **The Tower is where Heroes fight.**
>
> **Town Square is where they live.**
>
> Between battles, the Heroes of Aetheria return to a place where they can rest, work, train, trade, craft, communicate, and prepare for the next floor.
>
> Town Square is not merely a menu.
>
> **It is the living headquarters of the Master and the Heroes.**

---

# 1. TOWN SQUARE OVERVIEW

**Town Square** is the primary headquarters available to the Master outside active missions.

It functions as the central hub for:

```text
Hero Management
Facility Management
Crafting
Storage
Training
Recovery
Hero Assignment
Resource Processing
Trading
Quest Management
Character Interaction
Faction Interaction
Information
Daily Reset Management
Automatic Crafting
Inventory Synchronization
Crafting Result Synchronization
Daily Fairy Reporting
```

Town Square is designed as a living environment.

Heroes are not simply stored inside a menu.

They can:

```text
Work
Rest
Talk
Train
Craft
Assist
Explore
Manage Facilities
Interact with Other Heroes
Develop Relationships
Complete Guild Quests
```

All Facility crafting operates automatically according to the Facility Leader, AI Character, available materials, active priorities, and configured recipes.

Every successful crafting result is added to the Inventory, while all required materials are automatically deducted from the Inventory.

