# 2. TOWN SQUARE CONCEPT

The Town Square takes inspiration from the **central lobby / headquarters concept of Pick Me Up**, where the Master manages Heroes between missions.

However, Aetheria expands this concept into a more dynamic simulation.

The Town Square is connected to:

```text
MASTER
   │
   ▼
TOWN SQUARE
   │
   ├── FACILITIES
   ├── HEROES
   ├── CRAFTING
   ├── INVENTORY
   ├── GUILD QUEST
   ├── TRAINING
   ├── SHOP
   ├── DAILY RESET
   ├── FAIRY SYNCHRONIZATION
   └── WORLD INFORMATION
```

