# 6. FACILITY LEADER SYSTEM

Every important Facility must have:

# **FACILITY LEADER SLOT**

The Master assigns a Hero as the leader or manager of the Facility.

Example:

```text
BLACKSMITH

Leader:
Hero ID: HERO-00125

Role:
Blacksmith Leader
```

The assigned Hero becomes responsible for managing the Facility.

The Facility Leader determines the Facility's routine behavior through the AI Character System.

