# 18. GUILD QUEST PARTY RESTRICTION

Guild Hall quests are not completed by the Master directly.

Guild Hall quests can only be completed by:

# **PARTY 3 AND ABOVE**

This means:

```text
Party 1 → Cannot complete Guild Hall quests
Party 2 → Cannot complete Guild Hall quests
Party 3 → Can complete Guild Hall quests
Party 4 → Can complete Guild Hall quests
Party 5 → Can complete Guild Hall quests
Party 6 → Can complete Guild Hall quests
```

The restriction applies to all Guild Hall quest assignments unless a specific quest states otherwise.

---

# 19. GUILD QUEST PARTY ELIGIBILITY

A Party is eligible to complete Guild Hall quests when:

```text
Party Number >= 3
Party is Active
Party is not Defeated
Party has Available Quest Capacity
Party meets Quest Requirements
```

Example:

```text
PARTY 1
→ Dungeon Mission Only

PARTY 2
→ Dungeon Mission Only

PARTY 3
→ Dungeon Mission + Guild Hall Quest

PARTY 4
→ Dungeon Mission + Guild Hall Quest
```

---

# 20. GUILD QUEST AUTOMATION

Guild Hall quests are assigned and processed automatically.

The Master does not need to manually control every quest action.

Basic flow:

```text
GUILD HALL
      ↓
QUEST AVAILABLE
      ↓
AI FAIRY CHECKS ELIGIBLE PARTIES
      ↓
PARTY 3 AND ABOVE
      ↓
QUEST REQUIREMENT CHECK
      ↓
PARTY ASSIGNMENT
      ↓
QUEST START
      ↓
TIME SYSTEM
      ↓
QUEST COMPLETION
      ↓
REWARD GENERATED
      ↓
REWARD SYNCHRONIZATION
      ↓
DAILY REPORT
```

---

# 21. GUILD QUEST PARTY SELECTION

The AI Fairy selects an eligible Party according to:

```text
Party Number
Party Availability
Quest Requirements
Hero Skills
Party Condition
Current Mission
Quest Difficulty
Quest Priority
```

The default rule is:

```text
Select the lowest available eligible Party
```

Therefore, Party 3 is selected before Party 4 when both are available.

Example:

```text
Quest Available
      ↓
Check Party 3
      ↓
Party 3 Available
      ↓
Assign Quest to Party 3
```

If Party 3 is unavailable:

```text
Check Party 4
      ↓
Party 4 Available
      ↓
Assign Quest to Party 4
```

