```

---

# 27. REWARD SYNCHRONIZATION RULES

The AI Fairy must ensure that:

```text
No Reward Is Lost
No Reward Is Duplicated
Every Item Receives an Item ID
Every Resource Quantity Is Updated
Every Quest Is Marked Correctly
Every Party Receives the Correct Reward
```

If synchronization fails, the reward enters:

```text
PENDING REWARD
```

The AI Fairy reports the issue to the Master.

