Quest Progress Reset
Daily Reward Eligibility
Daily Quest History
Daily Party Assignment
Facility Crafting Synchronization
Crafting Result Synchronization
Inventory Synchronization
Daily Fairy Report
```

The Daily Reset is controlled by the Time System and Game State System.

The Daily Reset is the official synchronization point for all automatic Facility crafting results.

