# 31. DAILY RESET ORDER

The system must process the Daily Reset in this order:

```text
1. Detect Reset Time
2. Lock Daily Town Square State
3. Process All Completed Facility Crafting
4. Validate Crafting Results
5. Deduct Required Crafting Materials
6. Add Crafted Items and Resources to Inventory
7. Save Crafting History
8. Complete Valid Finished Guild Quests
9. Generate Pending Rewards
10. Synchronize All Quest Rewards
11. Save Previous Daily Records
12. Reset Daily Quest Counters
13. Generate New Daily Quests
14. Check Party 3 and Above
15. Assign Eligible Quests Automatically
16. Save New Town Square State
17. Create AI Fairy Daily Report
18. Notify the Master
```

This order prevents crafting materials, crafted items, and quest rewards from being lost or duplicated during the reset.

