# 32. DAILY RESET AND ACTIVE QUESTS

If a Guild Hall quest is still active when the Daily Reset occurs, the system follows the configured quest rule.

Default behavior:

```text
Completed Quest
→ Reward Immediately

Active Quest
→ Remains Active

Expired Quest
→ Marked Expired

Failed Quest
→ Marked Failed
```

An active quest is not automatically deleted unless the quest specifically requires daily expiration.

