# 34. AUTOMATIC CRAFTING RESULT RULE

The result of every successful craft from every Facility must be added to the Inventory automatically.

The required materials must be reduced from the Inventory automatically.

Example:

```text
BEFORE CRAFTING

Iron:
10

Wood:
5

Leather:
3
```

Recipe:

```text
IRON SWORD

Required:
Iron × 5
Wood × 2
Leather × 1
```

After successful crafting:

```text
AFTER CRAFTING

Iron:
5

Wood:
3

Leather:
2

Inventory Added:
Iron Sword × 1
```

The transaction must be recorded as one synchronized operation.

---

# 35. AUTOMATIC CRAFTING TRANSACTION

Every Facility crafting transaction follows:

```text
CRAFTING TASK CREATED
      ↓
RECIPE CHECK
      ↓
INVENTORY MATERIAL CHECK
      ↓
MATERIAL RESERVED
      ↓
CRAFTING PROCESS
      ↓
CRAFTING COMPLETED
      ↓
RNG RESULT
      ↓
MATERIALS DEDUCTED
      ↓
CRAFTED ITEM CREATED
      ↓
ITEM ADDED TO INVENTORY
      ↓
CRAFTING HISTORY UPDATED
      ↓
GAME STATE UPDATED
      ↓
DATABASE SAVED
```

Materials must not be deducted before the recipe and crafting task are validated.

If the crafting task fails before completion, reserved materials are returned unless the recipe explicitly defines a failure cost.

---

# 36. CRAFTING MATERIAL RESERVATION

When a Facility begins crafting, the required materials may be reserved.

Example:

```text
Inventory:
Iron × 10

Crafting Task:
Iron Sword
Required:
Iron × 5

Reserved:
Iron × 5

Available:
Iron × 5
```

Reserved materials cannot be used by another Facility or crafting task.

This prevents multiple Facilities from consuming the same materials.

---

# 37. CRAFTING RESULT STATES

Every automatic crafting task has a state:

```text
QUEUED
WAITING_FOR_MATERIALS
MATERIALS_RESERVED
IN_PROGRESS
COMPLETED
FAILED
CANCELLED
SYNCHRONIZED
PENDING_SYNCHRONIZATION
```

Only a task with the state:

```text
COMPLETED
```

can generate a final crafting result.

After the result is added to Inventory, the task becomes:

```text
SYNCHRONIZED
```

---

# 38. CRAFTING RESULT SYNCHRONIZATION FAILURE

If a crafted result cannot be added to Inventory during the Daily Reset:

```text
CRAFTING COMPLETE
