# 108. IMPORTANT DESIGN RULES

### Rule 1

Every major Facility has:

```text
1 Leader Slot
```

### Rule 2

The Leader is a real Hero Character.

### Rule 3

The Leader can request assistance from Heroes not currently assigned to active Parties.

### Rule 4

Heroes maintain their own:

```text
Personality
Emotion
Relationship
Skills
Condition
```

### Rule 5

Crafting operates automatically for all Facilities that support production.

### Rule 6

Crafting checks and reserves required materials from the Inventory.

### Rule 7

When crafting succeeds, required materials are reduced from the Inventory.

### Rule 8

When crafting succeeds, the crafted item or resource is added to the Inventory.

### Rule 9

Crafting material deduction and crafting result addition must be processed as one synchronized transaction.

### Rule 10

AI decides suitable activities.

### Rule 11

RNG determines randomized crafting and quest results.

### Rule 12

Important Town changes are processed through the Game State System.

### Rule 13

Persistent data is stored in the Database System.

### Rule 14

AI Fairy reports important changes to the Master.

### Rule 15

Guild Hall quests can only be completed by Party 3 and above.

### Rule 16

Party 1 and Party 2 are ineligible for Guild Hall quests unless a special rule overrides this restriction.

### Rule 17

Guild Hall quest assignment is automated by the AI Fairy.

### Rule 18

Every Guild Hall reward must be synchronized with the Inventory System.

### Rule 19

The Daily Reset must process completed Facility crafting before finalizing the daily synchronization.

### Rule 20

The Daily Reset must process completed quests and rewards before resetting daily quest data.

### Rule 21

The AI Fairy must create a report for the Master after every Daily Reset.

### Rule 22

Pending or failed reward synchronization must never delete the reward.

### Rule 23

Pending or failed crafting synchronization must never delete the crafted result.

### Rule 24

The same Craft ID cannot generate duplicate crafting results.

### Rule 25

The same Reward ID cannot generate duplicate quest rewards.

### Rule 26

The AI Fairy performs automatic synchronization at every Daily Reset.

### Rule 27

The AI Fairy sends a Daily Report to the Master after every Daily Reset.

