# 112. FINAL CONCEPT

Town Square is the **living headquarters of Aetheria**.

The Master does not need to manually control every Hero.

Instead:

```text
MASTER
   ↓
STRATEGIC COMMAND
   ↓
FACILITY LEADER
   ↓
AI MANAGEMENT
   ↓
HERO WORKERS
   ↓
AUTOMATIC CRAFTING
   ↓
RNG RESULT
   ↓
MATERIALS REDUCED
   ↓
CRAFTED RESULT ADDED TO INVENTORY
   ↓
GAME STATE
```

For Guild Hall quests:

```text
DAILY RESET
   ↓
AI FAIRY
   ↓
CHECK PARTY 3 AND ABOVE
   ↓
AUTOMATIC QUEST ASSIGNMENT
   ↓
QUEST COMPLETION
   ↓
REWARD SYNCHRONIZATION
   ↓
INVENTORY UPDATE
   ↓
DAILY REPORT
   ↓
MASTER
```

For Facility crafting:

```text
FACILITY
   ↓
AUTOMATIC RECIPE SELECTION
   ↓
MATERIAL CHECK
   ↓
CRAFTING
   ↓
MATERIALS REDUCED
   ↓
CRAFTED ITEM / RESOURCE ADDED TO INVENTORY
   ↓
DAILY FAIRY SYNCHRONIZATION
   ↓
DAILY REPORT
   ↓
MASTER
```

This creates a system where Heroes can develop their own lives and responsibilities.

The Master gives direction.

The Leaders manage.

The Heroes work, interact, train, rest, and develop.

Party 3 and above automatically handle Guild Hall quests.

All Facilities automatically process their crafting and production tasks.

Required crafting materials are reduced from the Inventory.

Crafted items and resources are added to the Inventory.

The AI manages routine activities.

The RNG introduces uncertainty.

The Reward System distributes quest rewards.

The Inventory System records every reward and crafting result.

The Daily Reset synchronizes all Facility crafting results and Guild Hall rewards.

The Game State System records the consequences.

The Database preserves the world.

And the AI Fairy tells the Master what happened after every reset.

