# 113. TOWN SQUARE PHILOSOPHY

> **A Hero is not an item inside the Master's inventory.**

> **A Hero is a living character.**

> They have skills.

> They have emotions.

> They have relationships.

> They have opinions.

> They can work.

> They can refuse.

> They can help others.

> They can become leaders.

> They can build something.

> They can make mistakes.

> They can create something the Master never expected.

> They can join Guild Hall quests when they belong to Party 3 or above.

> They can bring rewards back to the Town Square.

> They can create items and resources through automatic Facility crafting.

> Their required materials can be consumed automatically.

> Their crafted results can be added automatically to the Inventory.

> Their achievements can be synchronized, recorded, and reported automatically after every Daily Reset.

And while the Master climbs the Tower to save Aetheria:

> **The Town Square becomes the place where the Heroes learn how to live again.**
